    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Kathleen Brennan",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110606078884178365389/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX0mKbgmSC-JSjWveMJVqYQ9033SETm7uy60_rbZmC2TrzThMY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "If you're looking to buy or sell your home look no further. Amelia and her team, Alexandra and Bhavesh, are simply wonderful.  When we first met Amelia we were amazed at how easily she helped us understand the process of selling our home.  She and her team kept us well informed throughout. Besides being friendly and courteous all three are very professional; a real class act. They made the whole experience enjoyable. Thank you all for your hard work and dedication.  Jean and I can't wait to recommend Team Amelia Grich to family and friends.",
        "time": 1761763682,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Valerie Shannon",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114923907549009634552/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU7_cHeqzQh_zJTRzcB8APWIKRAt5XVqL10ke8x3VsZZhiWMCvU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "We had an outstanding experience working with Amelia Grich and her team! She quickly understood exactly what we were looking for and worked with us very effectively, eventhough we were in another province. Thanks to her, we found a property in the neighborhood we wanted, within our budget, and on the timeline we needed.\n\nShe was incredibly competent, proactive, and went above and beyond — not only helping us secure a great investment property but also guiding us through every step up to the lease agreement, which made the entire process smooth and stress-free.\n\nWe’re so grateful for her professionalism, patience, kindness, and expertise. Highly recommend her to anyone looking to buy or invest in the area!",
        "time": 1761577321,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Sarah",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100623301378295054080/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVCa8a6ScUNPs9ded1AHta59pvvpGV3dSC-MGcSfWhxlUuwNFpDJA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Amelia, Bhavesh, and Alexandra were absolutely amazing! As young first-time home buyers, we honestly had no clue what we were doing, and finding this team was the best thing that could’ve happened to us. They helped us breathe through the stress and made such a complicated process feel manageable.\n\nBhavesh was incredible during home visits; always honest, never pushy, and genuinely cared about helping us find our home, not just any house. It truly felt like we were a team. They worked fast, communicated so well, and were always there when we needed them.\n\nWe couldn’t have done this without them. We’re so grateful for everything they did and couldn’t recommend them enough!",
        "time": 1761218868,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Gillian Wise",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107307152869171543028/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK9D1q6-lp1N8928KBC7_GgwlqzeD-5tlgRMVaB4ImGF2uyPA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "We bought our first home in 2020 with the help of Amelia and her team. Amelia was so professional, communicative, patient and supportive during the process. She maintained a great relationship with the seller's agent and ultimately, this was the reason our offer was accepted - we truly would not have our house if it wasn't for her! Could not recommend her services more and we will definitely be calling her for future sales/purchases.",
        "time": 1622211668,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Monira Lyasidi",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113123218702050105003/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK1h3rPszUyYDz1LUVwh9_unV759K1W56A4QHvYfWGsF3SbZQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "I had an amazing experience working with Amelia! From our very first meeting, she was professional, attentive, and truly committed to helping me find the perfect place in Nun’s Island.\n\nHer knowledge of the market, quick responsiveness, and honest advice made the entire process smooth and stress-free.\n\nI couldn’t have asked for a better real estate partner. Highly recommend!",
